          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/associative+3-form"} associative 3-form
          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li
              The English Wikipedia article
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seven-dimensional_cross_product"} Seven-dimensional cross product
              actually covers all non-zero vector-valued cross products in finite dimensions over the real numbers.
